INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

Q1. Does Continuous Delivery automatically deploy software to
production?

Answer

No.

Continuous Delivery prepares the application for deployment, but the
actual deployment to production requires manual approval.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q2. What is the biggest difference between Continuous Integration and
Continuous Delivery?

Answer

Continuous Integration automatically builds and tests the application.

Continuous Delivery automatically prepares the application for release
after successful CI, but production deployment is still manual.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q3. Is Continuous Delivery the same as Continuous Deployment?

Answer

No.

Continuous Delivery requires manual approval before production
deployment.

Continuous Deployment automatically deploys every successful build to
production.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q4. Why is manual approval used in Continuous Delivery?

Answer

Manual approval provides an additional quality gate before production
deployment, reducing deployment risk and allowing business teams to
choose the appropriate release time.

